# pond/_util/kvpack — FRICTION

No open contract deviations.

## unbounded-alloc triage — 2026-08-03 (first recorded)

One default-on warning at hale v0.13.0: `KvPack::set`'s
string-concat rebuild loop (`kvpack.hl:93`). FP-shaped: the
loop walks the existing pack once (bounded by pack length) to
splice the replaced pair; the rebuilt string is the method's
return value, not retained state. Rebuild-on-write is the lib's
documented TSV-pack design. No source change.

